  <!-- EN: river wader -->
  <VFEM_RiverWader112.titleShort>涉水渔人</VFEM_RiverWader112.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] was the smallest and weakest of [PAWN_possessive] peers, often picked on by others. To survive, [PAWN_pronoun] learned to think fast and avoid direct conflicts, relying on cunning to outsmart [PAWN_possessive] tormentors. Though quick and clever, [PAWN_pronoun] grew up mistrustful and fiercely independent. -->
  <VFEM_RuntOfThePack130.description>[PAWN_nameDef]是同龄人中最弱小的，经常被其他人欺负。为了生存，[PAWN_pronoun]学会了快速思考并避免直接冲突，依靠聪明才智智胜欺凌者。尽管机敏聪慧，[PAWN_pronoun]却变得多疑且极度独立。</VFEM_RuntOfThePack130.description>
