  <VFEM_RuntOfThePack130.titleShort>弱者</VFEM_RuntOfThePack130.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] collected broken tools, discarded wood, and other castoffs, turning them into makeshift toys or tools. Though often teased for [PAWN_possessive] peculiar habits, [PAWN_pronoun] became adept at finding value in things others overlooked. [PAWN_pronoun] gained practical skills but struggled to connect with others. -->
  <VFEM_ScrapHoarder127.description>[PAWN_nameDef]收集破损的工具、废弃的木材和其他丢弃物，并将它们制作成临时的玩具或工具。尽管因这种怪异的习惯而常被嘲笑，[PAWN_pronoun]却擅长在被他人忽视的物品中发现价值。[PAWN_pronoun]因此掌握了实用技能，但难以与他人建立联系。</VFEM_ScrapHoarder127.description>
