  <VFEM_ScrapHoarder127.titleShort>囤积者</VFEM_ScrapHoarder127.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] spent [PAWN_possessive] childhood helping [PAWN_possessive] family tend sheep on the hillsides near the village. [PAWN_pronoun] learned patience, vigilance, and a deep understanding of animal behavior. The quiet life also gave [PAWN_pronoun] plenty of time to dream and observe the world around [PAWN_objective]. -->
  <VFEM_ShepherdsChild102.description>[PAWN_nameDef]的童年是在村庄附近的山坡上帮助家人放羊度过的。[PAWN_pronoun]学会了耐心、警觉，以及对动物行为的深刻理解。宁静的生活也让 [PAWN_pronoun]有充足的时间思考和观察周围的世界。</VFEM_ShepherdsChild102.description>
  <!-- EN: shepherd's child -->
