  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] was trained from a young age to carry shields and assist warriors during raids and battles. [PAWN_pronoun] learned to endure heavy loads and follow commands, watching closely as the older fighters honed their skills. The experience prepared [PAWN_pronoun] for a life of conflict and loyalty to [PAWN_possessive] clan. -->
  <VFEM_ShieldBearer137.description>[PAWN_nameDef]从小接受训练，负责扛盾牌并在突袭和战斗中协助战士。[PAWN_pronoun]学会了忍受沉重的负担并服从命令，同时观察年长的战士如何磨练自己的技艺。这段经历让 [PAWN_pronoun]为充满冲突的生活做好了准备，并对自己的部族忠心耿耿。</VFEM_ShieldBearer137.description>
