  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] grew up in the stables, helping care for horses and keeping the stalls clean. [PAWN_pronoun] learned the basics of animal care and the value of steady, dependable work. While comfortable around animals, [PAWN_pronoun] often struggled to relate to [PAWN_possessive] peers. -->
  <VFEM_StablehandsChild110.description>[PAWN_nameDef]在马厩中长大，帮助照料马匹并清理马厩。[PAWN_pronoun]学会了基础的动物护理知识，并理解了稳定可靠的工作价值。虽然 [PAWN_pronoun]对动物很有亲和力，但在人际交往方面却显得笨拙。</VFEM_StablehandsChild110.description>
