  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] performed in the village square as a juggler, singer, or storyteller, hoping to earn coins or scraps of food. [PAWN_pronoun] learned how to capture an audience’s attention and bring joy to others, even when times were tough. While talented in performance, [PAWN_pronoun] struggled with practical skills outside the arts. -->
  <VFEM_StreetEntertainer120.description>[PAWN_nameDef]曾在村庄广场上表演杂耍、歌唱或讲故事，希望能赚取硬币或换取一点食物。[PAWN_pronoun]学会了如何吸引观众的注意力，并在艰难时期带给他人欢乐。尽管表演才华出众，[PAWN_pronoun]却在艺术之外的实际技能上表现欠佳。</VFEM_StreetEntertainer120.description>
