  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] grew up scavenging through garbage and refuse, searching for anything [PAWN_pronoun] could eat or sell. The harsh life taught [PAWN_pronoun] how to survive with very little but left [PAWN_pronoun] mistrusting of others. [PAWN_pronoun] became quick on [PAWN_possessive] feet to avoid confrontations over scraps. -->
  <VFEM_StreetScavenger121.description>[PAWN_nameDef]在垃圾堆和废料中寻找可以吃或卖的东西。[PAWN_pronoun]在艰难的生活中学会了如何用最少的资源生存，但也因此对他人充满戒心。[PAWN_pronoun]变得行动敏捷，以便在争夺食物时避开冲突。</VFEM_StreetScavenger121.description>
