  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] was known for causing mischief and stirring up chaos, often at the expense of others. [PAWN_pronoun] enjoyed playing pranks, picking fights, and pushing boundaries wherever possible. Though disliked by adults and peers alike, [PAWN_pronoun] developed sharp wits and quick reflexes to avoid punishment. -->
  <VFEM_Troublemaker125.description>[PAWN_nameDef]以制造混乱和捣乱而闻名，往往让他人吃亏。[PAWN_pronoun]喜欢恶作剧、挑衅斗殴，并不断挑战规则。尽管无论是大人还是同龄人都不喜欢 [PAWN_pronoun]，[PAWN_pronoun]却因此培养了敏锐的机智和快速的反应能力，以躲避惩罚。</VFEM_Troublemaker125.description>
