  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] spent much of [PAWN_possessive] childhood collecting firewood, herbs, and other necessities for the village. The long days outdoors gave [PAWN_pronoun] an eye for useful plants and a steady hand for simple tools. [PAWN_pronoun] grew up practical and capable, well-suited to life in the countryside. -->
  <VFEM_VillageGatherer135.description>[PAWN_nameDef]的童年大部分时间都花在收集柴火、草药和其他村庄必需品上。漫长的户外劳作让[PAWN_pronoun]对有用的植物有敏锐的洞察力，并锻炼了使用简单工具的稳定手法。[PAWN_pronoun]因此成长为一个务实且能干的人，非常适应乡村生活。</VFEM_VillageGatherer135.description>
