  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] spent [PAWN_possessive] childhood running errands and helping with small tasks around the village. Whether delivering goods, fetching water, or mending fences, [PAWN_pronoun] was always willing to lend a hand. These simple chores instilled [PAWN_pronoun] with a strong work ethic and practical skills. -->
  <VFEM_VillageHelper132.description>[PAWN_nameDef]的童年是在村庄里跑腿和帮忙做各种琐事中度过的。无论是送货、取水，还是修补围栏，[PAWN_pronoun]总是乐于助人。这些简单的杂务培养了[PAWN_pronoun]的勤劳品质和实用技能。</VFEM_VillageHelper132.description>
