  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] was often tasked with delivering messages and small packages between villagers. [PAWN_pronoun] spent countless hours running along dirt paths, learning the fastest routes and how to avoid danger. The constant movement made [PAWN_pronoun] quick and agile but left little time for rest or study. -->
  <VFEM_VillageRunner116.description>[PAWN_nameDef]经常被派去在村民之间传递消息和小型包裹。[PAWN_pronoun]花费无数小时奔跑在泥泞小路上，学会了最快的路径以及如何避开危险。不断的奔波让[PAWN_pronoun]变得迅捷敏捷，但几乎没有时间休息或学习。</VFEM_VillageRunner116.description>
