  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] grew up as a street child in a small village, surviving by stealing scraps and begging from passersby. [PAWN_pronoun] quickly learned to navigate crowded markets and avoid the watchful eyes of the guards. Though [PAWN_pronoun] lacked formal education, [PAWN_pronoun] became clever and resourceful. -->
  <VFEM_VillageUrchin101.description>[PAWN_nameDef]在一个小村庄里作为街头流浪儿长大，靠偷窃食物残渣或向路人乞讨生存。[PAWN_pronoun]很快学会了如何穿梭于拥挤的集市，并避开警卫的监视。尽管缺乏正式教育，[PAWN_pronoun]却因此变得机智而足智多谋。</VFEM_VillageUrchin101.description>
