  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] was responsible for keeping the village well clean and drawing water for the community. [PAWN_pronoun] grew strong from hauling heavy buckets and learned to maintain the mechanisms that made the work easier. The repetitive work left [PAWN_pronoun] with little variety but a dependable skill set. -->
  <VFEM_WellTender119.description>[PAWN_nameDef]负责保持村庄水井的清洁，并为村民们打水。[PAWN_pronoun]在搬运沉重的水桶过程中变得力大无穷，并学会了如何维护水井的运作机制。虽然这项工作单调乏味，但也让[PAWN_pronoun]掌握了一项稳定而可靠的技能。</VFEM_WellTender119.description>
